---
title: Pistachio Salad
source: Grandma Schwennesen
---

In a #large bowl{}, mix together dry @instant pistachio pudding{1%small package}, @crushed pineapple with juice{20%oz}, @miniature marshmallows{1%cup}, and @pecans{1/2%cup}(chopped).

Add thawed @Cool Whip{8%oz} and mix until well combined.

Chill before serving.
